abstract:
Let $ACG(2
u,\mathbb{F}_q)$ be the $2
u$-dimensional classical affine space with parameter $e$ over a $q$-element finite field $\mathbb{F}_q$, and ${\cal O}_{
u}$ be the set of all maximal totally isotropic flats in $ACG(2
u,\mathbb{F}_q)$. In this paper, we discuss Cameron-Liebler sets in ${\cal O}_{
u}$, obtain several equivalent definitions and present some classification results.
